      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَشُوفٌ</span></b>  <i>Sweet in the mouth; sweet-mouthed;</i> [as
though her saliva were sucked in by her lover
because of its sweetness;] applied to a woman.
(S, O, Msb, K.) ― 
